      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1>Threatening Roar</h1><p><em>A bellow rolls out of the ogre’s broad chest.</em></p><h2>Rules</h2><p><strong>ID:</strong> monster-hill-ogre-threatening-roar</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Maneuver</p><p>One hearing creature within 3 squares gains Frightened 1 of the ogre; once per turn.</p><p><strong>Limits:</strong> Costs its Maneuver; no extra action is granted.</p>"
